       "Si falla la 2 o la 3, la persona es **inactiva**, no parada. Un estudiante que no trabaja no tiene trabajo, pero no es parado: es inactivo.",
       "If 2 or 3 fails, the person is **inactive**, not unemployed. A student who does not work has no job, but is not unemployed: they are inactive."
