        "¿Qué diferencia hay entre el PIB y el PNB? Calcula el PNB si PIB = 2.000, rfne = 50 y rfen = 130.",
        "What is the difference between GDP and GNP? Calculate GNP if GDP = 2,000, rfne = 50 and rfen = 130."
